			"notes": "# 🎥 CinematicTools v1.1.0 for Minecraft 1.20.1 and 1.20.4\n\n### This is the second release of CinematicTools — a Fabric port and extension of the classic CMDCam mod. It now adds support for rendering the local player during outside camera playback, continuing to expand the tools available for creating smooth cinematic scenes in Minecraft.\n\n## ✨ Features:\n\n- **Render yourself in outside mode during cinematics**\n\n- **Updated GeckoLib to v4.7.1.3** (_This only for the 1.20.1 version_)"
